{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "03-secondary-user-v3-updated",
		"name": "03 - Secondary User Role (Student/Child) - UPDATED v3",
		"description": "Team Member - View & Complete Tasks with Real-Time Updates\n\n## Responsibilities\n- View assigned tasks\n- Complete tasks and update status\n- Track daily progress\n- Create personal tasks\n- Create group tasks (if permission granted)\n- Choose support mode (Calm/Encouraging/Logical)\n- Set notification style (Gentle/Firm/XYZ)\n- **NEW**: Check own permission status (Secondary User or not)\n- **NEW**: Get family members for task assignment\n- **NEW**: Bulk create tasks with subtasks in single request\n- **NEW**: Real-time Socket.IO integration\n- **NEW**: Task progress tracking with parent notifications\n\n## Figma Reference\n- App User (Mobile)\n- Individual User / Group User\n- Home Screen with Tasks\n- Task Status/History\n- Profile with Support Mode\n- Notification Settings\n- **NEW**: add-task-flow-for-permission-account-interface.png\n\n## Socket.IO Integration\n- Auto-join personal room on connect\n- Auto-join family room on connect\n- Join task rooms for real-time updates\n- Parent receives real-time notifications\n\n## Variables\n- BASE_URL: http://localhost:5000/api/v1\n- SECONDARY_USER_TOKEN: Your JWT token\n- TASK_ID: Test task ID\n- CHILD_USER_ID: Child user ID",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"version": "3.0.0"
	},
	"variable": [
		{"key": "BASE_URL", "value": "http://localhost:5000/api/v1", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "SECONDARY_USER_TOKEN", "value": "", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "TASK_ID", "value": "", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "SUBTASK_ID", "value": "", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "CHILD_USER_ID", "value": "", "type": "string"},
		{"key": "PARENT_BUSINESS_USER_ID", "value": "", "type": "string"}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "00 - Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register Secondary User",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"SECONDARY_USER_EMAIL\", jsonData.data.user.email);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Alex Student\",\n  \"email\": \"alex@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"StudentPass123!\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/register",
							"host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
							"path": ["auth", "register"]
						},
						"description": "Register as a secondary user (student/child)\n\n**Rate Limit**: 10 per hour"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Login as Secondary User",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"SECONDARY_USER_TOKEN\", jsonData.data.tokens.accessToken);",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"SECONDARY_USER_ID\", jsonData.data.user._id);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alex@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"StudentPass123!\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/auth/login",
							"host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
							"path": ["auth", "login"]
						},
						"description": "Login and save token to SECONDARY_USER_TOKEN variable\n\n**Rate Limit**: 5 attempts per 15 minutes"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "01 - Permission & Family (NEW)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "✅ NEW - Get My Permission Status",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    const isSecondary = jsonData.data.isSecondaryUser;",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"IS_SECONDARY_USER\", isSecondary);",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"PARENT_BUSINESS_USER_ID\", jsonData.data.parentBusinessUserId);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"auth": {"type": "bearer", "bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{SECONDARY_USER_TOKEN}}"}]},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/children-business-users/my-permission",
							"host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
							"path": ["children-business-users", "my-permission"]
						},
						"description": "✅ NEW API - Check if logged-in child has Secondary User permission\n\n**Figma**: add-task-flow-for-permission-account-interface.png\n\n**Response**:\n```json\n{\n  \"isSecondaryUser\": true,\n  \"parentBusinessUserId\": \"507f1f77bcf86cd799439011\",\n  \"parentName\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"canCreateTasksForOthers\": true,\n    \"canViewTeamTasks\": true,\n    \"canAssignToTeamMembers\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Use Case**: Before showing task creation UI, check if user can create tasks for others or only personal tasks"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "✅ NEW - Get My Family Members",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    // Save family member IDs for task assignment",
									"    if (jsonData.data.length > 0) {",
									"        pm.environment.set(\"FAMILY_MEMBER_1\", jsonData.data[0].childUserId);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"auth": {"type": "bearer", "bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{SECONDARY_USER_TOKEN}}"}]},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/children-business-users/my-family-members",
							"host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
							"path": ["children-business-users", "my-family-members"]
						},
						"description": "✅ NEW API - Get other children (siblings) under the same parent\n\n**Figma**: add-task-flow-for-permission-account-interface.png (Assign To dropdown)\n\n**Response**:\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"_id\": \"507f191e810c19729de860ea\",\n    \"childUserId\": \"507f191e810c19729de860ea\",\n    \"name\": \"Alice Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n    \"isSecondaryUser\": false,\n    \"roleType\": \"Primary\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"_id\": \"507f191e810c19729de860eb\",\n    \"childUserId\": \"507f191e810c19729de860eb\",\n    \"name\": \"Bob Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"bob@example.com\",\n    \"isSecondaryUser\": true,\n    \"roleType\": \"Secondary\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n**Use Case**: Populate \"Assign To\" dropdown when creating collaborative or single assignment tasks"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "02 - Home & Tasks",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "01 - Create Personal Task",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"TASK_ID\", jsonData.data._id);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"auth": {"type": "bearer", "bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{SECONDARY_USER_TOKEN}}"}]},
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"My Personal Task\",\n  \"description\": \"Task for myself only\",\n  \"taskType\": \"personal\",\n  \"priority\": \"medium\",\n  \"startTime\": \"2026-03-17T10:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"scheduledTime\": \"10:00 AM\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/tasks",
							"host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
							"path": ["tasks"]
						},
						"description": "Create a personal task for yourself only\n\n**Figma**: personal-task.png\n\n**Validation**:\n- Cannot have assignedUserIds\n- Max 5 personal tasks per day\n- Auto-sets ownerUserId to current user\n\n**Permission**: Must be Secondary User\n**Rate Limit**: 30 requests/hour\n**Daily Limit**: Max 5 personal tasks per day"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "02 - Create Single Assignment Task",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"TASK_ID\", jsonData.data._id);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"auth": {"type": "bearer", "bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{SECONDARY_USER_TOKEN}}"}]},
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Math Homework\",\n  \"description\": \"Complete chapter 5 exercises\",\n  \"taskType\": \"singleAssignment\",\n  \"priority\": \"high\",\n  \"startTime\": \"2026-03-17T14:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"scheduledTime\": \"2:00 PM\",\n  \"assignedUserIds\": [\":childUserId\"]\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/tasks",
							"host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
							"path": ["tasks"]
						},
						"description": "Create a task assigned to exactly ONE person\n\n**Figma**: single-assignment.png\n\n**Validation**:\n- Must have exactly 1 user in assignedUserIds\n- No daily limit\n- Replace :childUserId with actual user ID\n\n**Permission**: Must be Secondary User\n**Rate Limit**: 30 requests/hour"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "03 - Create Collaborative Task",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"TASK_ID\", jsonData.data._id);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"auth": {"type": "bearer", "bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{SECONDARY_USER_TOKEN}}"}]},
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Family Room Cleanup\",\n  \"description\": \"Clean the living room together\",\n  \"taskType\": \"collaborative\",\n  \"priority\": \"medium\",\n  \"startTime\": \"2026-03-17T16:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"scheduledTime\": \"4:00 PM\",\n  \"assignedUserIds\": [\n    \":childUserId1\",\n    \":childUserId2\"\n  ]\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/tasks",
							"host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
							"path": ["tasks"]
						},
						"description": "Create a task assigned to MULTIPLE people (family/group task)\n\n**Figma**: collaborative-task.png\n\n**Validation**:\n- Must have 2 or more users in assignedUserIds\n- No daily limit\n- Replace :childUserId1, :childUserId2 with actual user IDs\n- Get user IDs from: GET /children-business-users/my-family-members\n\n**Permission**: Must be Secondary User\n**Rate Limit**: 30 requests/hour\n\n**Real-Time**: All assigned users receive Socket.IO notification"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "✅ UPDATED - Create Task with Bulk Subtasks",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"TASK_ID\", jsonData.data._id);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"auth": {"type": "bearer", "bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{SECONDARY_USER_TOKEN}}"}]},
						"header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Complete Math Homework\",\n  \"description\": \"Finish exercises 1-10 from chapter 5\",\n  \"taskType\": \"singleAssignment\",\n  \"priority\": \"high\",\n  \"startTime\": \"2026-03-25T08:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"scheduledTime\": \"8:00 AM\",\n  \"assignedUserIds\": [\":childUserId\"],\n  \"subtasks\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Read chapter 5\",\n      \"duration\": 30,\n      \"order\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solve exercises 1-5\",\n      \"duration\": 45,\n      \"order\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solve exercises 6-10\",\n      \"duration\": 45,\n      \"order\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Review answers\",\n      \"duration\": 15,\n      \"order\": 4\n    }\n  ]\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/tasks",
							"host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
							"path": ["tasks"]
						},
						"description": "✅ UPDATED - Create task with subtasks in a SINGLE API call\n\n**Figma**: add-task-flow-for-permission-account-interface.png\n\n**What Changed**:\n- Before: Create task, then add subtasks one-by-one (multiple API calls)\n- After: Create task + all subtasks in one request (bulk creation)\n\n**Subtasks Array**:\n- title (required): Subtask title (max 200 chars)\n- duration (optional): Duration in minutes\n- isCompleted (optional): Default false\n- order (optional): Auto-incremented if not provided\n\n**Benefits**:\n- Single API call instead of N+1\n- Atomic operation (all or nothing)\n- Better performance (bulk insert)\n- Matches Figma UX flow exactly\n\n**Note**: Replace :childUserId with actual user ID from family members API"
					},
					"response": []
				},
